 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Mythical Beast Amber — Innate Technique (6th level)</em></p><p>When you reach 6th level, your control over your technique has improved to the point where you are able to separate the charges of electricity. After hitting a creature with <em>Electric Energy</em> you can mark the creature with a positive charge for 1 minute. You can have a number of charges on a target equal to twice your Cursed Energy Modifier. As an action you can expend charges to release a lightning bolt at one creature within 60 ft which heads straight for the accumulated charges dealing a number of d12s equal to the number of charges. <br />\n Starting at 11th level, this gains the limb-removing effect of the Limb Damage Table.  </p>",
